{"topic": "数据结构-AVL", "audience": "", "brief": {"objective": "学生能复述本页核心结论", "keyClaim": "AVL树的节点结构：存储高度而非平衡因子", "misconception": "", "visualTask": "视觉直接编码本页核心关系", "evidencePolicy": "none"}, "scene": {"id": "node-structure", "kind": "content", "headline": "AVL树的节点结构：存储高度而非平衡因子", "lead": "每个AVL节点存储键值、左右孩子指针和高度（height），通过高度可随时计算平衡因子，避免直接存储平衡因子带来的更新复杂性。", "notes": "介绍工程实现中的节点设计，强调存储高度的原因，纠正直接存储平衡因子的误解。", "blocks": [{"type": "freeform", "rationale": "现有block类型（code/callout/list）无法以网格布局直观展示节点字段结构，需要freeform自定义视觉排列。", "html": "<div style="display:grid; gap:var(--gap); padding:var(--spacing); border:2px solid var(--border-color); border-radius:12px; background:var(--bg-card); max-width:400px; margin:0 auto;"><div style="text-align:center; font-weight:bold; color:var(--text-primary); font-size:1.1em; margin-bottom:8px;">AVL 节点</div><div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap:var(--gap);"><div style="padding:12px; border:1px solid var(--border-color); border-radius:6px; background:var(--bg-secondary);"><div style="font-size:0.8em; color:var(--text-secondary);">key</div><div style="font-size:1.2em; font-weight:bold; color:var(--text-primary);">30</div></div><div style="padding:12px; border:1px solid var(--border-color); border-radius:6px; background:var(--bg-secondary);"><div style="font-size:0.8em; color:var(--text-secondary);">height</div><div style="font-size:1.2em; font-weight:bold; color:var(--text-primary);">2</div></div><div style="padding:12px; border:1px solid var(--border-color); border-radius:6px; background:var(--bg-secondary);"><div style="font-size:0.8em; color:var(--text-secondary);">left</div><div style="font-size:1.2em; font-weight:bold; color:var(--text-primary);">→ 18</div></div><div style="padding:12px; border:1px solid var(--border-color); border-radius:6px; background:var(--bg-secondary);"><div style="font-size:0.8em; color:var(--text-secondary);">right</div><div style="font-size:1.2em; font-weight:bold; color:var(--text-primary);">→ 40</div></div></div><div style="text-align:center; font-size:0.85em; color:var(--text-secondary); margin-top:8px;">平衡因子 = left.height - right.height</div></div>", "id": "ns-freeform"}, {"type": "callout", "label": "为什么存储高度？", "text": "高度更新只需 $height = 1 + \max(left.height, right.height)$，平衡因子可随时由 $balance = left.height - right.height$ 算出；直接存平衡因子在旋转时需同时更新多个节点，易出错。", "id": "ns-callout"}, {"type": "code", "language": "text", "source": "struct AVLNode {
    int key;
    struct AVLNode *left;
    struct AVLNode *right;
    int height;
};", "filename": "avl_node.h", "caption": "AVL节点结构体定义，包含键值、左右孩子指针和高度字段。", "id": "ns-code"}], "layout": {"kind": "index", "steps": [{"label": "以可视化方式展示AVL节点结…", "blockIds": ["ns-freeform"]}, {"label": "解释为什么存储高度而非平衡因…", "blockIds": ["ns-callout"]}, {"label": "提供AVL节点结构的C语言定…", "blockIds": ["ns-code"]}]}}, "referenceMaterial": "[none provided]"}

